# Iris runtime environment — systemd EnvironmentFile for iris.service and
# iris-voice.service. This file contains the owner passphrase: keep it 0600 and
# never commit it. The units themselves hold no secrets.
#
# Fill these in, then run deploy/install.sh again.
IRIS_DATABASE_URL=postgres://lab:labdev@127.0.0.1:5432/iris?sslmode=disable
IRIS_PASSPHRASE=change-me-owner-passphrase
IRIS_VOICE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3310
#
# After the Tailscale HTTPS hostname works, uncomment this so the session
# cookie is only sent over HTTPS:
# IRIS_COOKIE_SECURE=true
